00:08:08.279 --> 00:08:09.447 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但那孩子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:12.533 --> 00:08:13.659 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:14.869 --> 00:08:15.953 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:16.621 --> 00:08:18.789 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他真的受伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:18.873 --> 00:08:21.751 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>外面有辆马车等着带他去看医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:21.834 --> 00:08:25.671 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷薰女士 神谷活心流的代理师父</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:28.466 --> 00:08:30.843 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>从今天起 她就是你的师父了</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:31.802 --> 00:08:32.929 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下！</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:35.348 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在叫我学剑术吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:35.431 --> 00:08:36.682 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且还是跟这个丑女学？</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:36.766 --> 00:08:39.060 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父？这孩子是我的徒弟？</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:39.143 --> 00:08:40.144 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:43.022 --> 00:08:45.775 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>取决于你的努力程度</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:50.738 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要多强有多强</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:50.821 --> 00:08:52.031 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:53.157 --> 00:08:56.786 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 你刚刚又叫我丑女了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:57.286 --> 00:08:58.621 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么问题吗 丑女？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:58.704 --> 00:09:01.707 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我叫你别那么叫了！
-哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:01.791 --> 00:09:03.459 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-丑女…
-你说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.588 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎样 你先握着试试</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:07.672 --> 00:09:08.756 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:10.925 --> 00:09:11.884 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:11.968 --> 00:09:15.263 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不需要你指导 丑女！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:15.346 --> 00:09:18.474 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫你别那么叫我了！
我要把你打晕！</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:18.558 --> 00:09:20.935 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？试试呀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:21.018 --> 00:09:22.395 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰…</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:22.478 --> 00:09:24.647 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>两位都非常勇敢…</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 你也和他说说！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:26.983 --> 00:09:28.276 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这孩子的嘴太臭了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:28.359 --> 00:09:29.527 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>冷静</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:31.696 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是你的新徒弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:31.779 --> 00:09:33.030 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对他温柔一点…</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:33.114 --> 00:09:34.991 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>温柔个鬼啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:36.951 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷活心流）</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:40.413 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一、二、三…</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:40.496 --> 00:09:43.249 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>哇 有15多个人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:09:43.332 --> 00:09:46.377 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打倒剑客警官的流言传开了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.838 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流要振兴了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:09:49.797 --> 00:09:51.841 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-不好…
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:09:51.924 --> 00:09:54.135 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:09:54.218 --> 00:09:58.764 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不用神谷活心流 也不想带徒弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:09:58.848 --> 00:10:01.017 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你们是因为昨天的事来的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:01.726 --> 00:10:04.687 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉 你们得回去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:08.566 --> 00:10:10.276 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在没问题了</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:10.359 --> 00:10:11.277 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什…</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:14.572 --> 00:10:17.617 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你没叫他们走的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:20.119 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我能有好多徒弟呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:20.202 --> 00:10:25.416 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怀着一点点兴趣的人
只能坚持半年左右</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:25.916 --> 00:10:27.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就事与愿违了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:28.628 --> 00:10:33.674 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>相反 你应该花时间
教真正有动力的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:34.884 --> 00:10:38.262 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 我也是来变强的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:38.346 --> 00:10:40.431 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>结果是受这种小丫头指导？</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:40.514 --> 00:10:42.224 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-真是浪费时间
-小…</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:42.308 --> 00:10:45.144 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 你叫我变强</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:10:45.227 --> 00:10:47.438 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么不教我你的流派？</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:10:48.022 --> 00:10:51.776 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不想传授飞天御剑流</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:10:52.276 --> 00:10:54.320 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下只是个旁观者</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:10:54.820 --> 00:10:57.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是属于神谷活心流的</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:10:57.156 --> 00:10:59.659 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了活人剑 你就会变强</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:10:59.742 --> 00:11:01.827 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-别闹了！
-就要闹！</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:01.911 --> 00:11:03.329 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-但你都没在听…
-好吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:03.412 --> 00:11:04.497 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我等着瞧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:09.001 --> 00:11:09.960 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:10.044 --> 00:11:10.878 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:14.173 --> 00:11:15.383 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:15.883 --> 00:11:17.134 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:17.218 --> 00:11:18.302 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:19.345 --> 00:11:23.682 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的
一会儿没盯着他 他就跑去偷懒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:23.766 --> 00:11:26.769 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>说话粗鲁、性格固执、毫无胆量</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:26.852 --> 00:11:30.356 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心看上他什么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:31.107 --> 00:11:33.651 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来你就是这么想我的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:11:33.734 --> 00:11:36.654 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可没有答应要学这种流派！</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:11:37.154 --> 00:11:40.116 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我自己学总比跟你学好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:44.578 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再说啊 那天那些人来了又走
不是你的错</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:11:44.662 --> 00:11:49.625 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但即使已经澄清拔刀斋的虚假指控了
你的徒弟还是一个都没有回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:11:51.168 --> 00:11:52.336 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:57.216 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>可能大家厌倦代理师父了</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:04.765 --> 00:12:06.684 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰…薰小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:06.767 --> 00:12:09.270 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>请…请帮帮我们…</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:09.353 --> 00:12:10.729 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>平！</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:10.813 --> 00:12:11.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有佐藤！</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.691 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们的伤是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:13.774 --> 00:12:15.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>发生什么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:17.361 --> 00:12:18.988 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们现在逃不掉了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:19.071 --> 00:12:20.197 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们要杀了你们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:20.865 --> 00:12:22.658 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:22.741 --> 00:12:24.743 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们对我以前的徒弟做什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:24.827 --> 00:12:27.079 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴 别多管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:29.373 --> 00:12:30.583 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看我的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:37.673 --> 00:12:40.092 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:40.176 --> 00:12:41.302 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我解释一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:12:43.387 --> 00:12:48.267 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个…他们喝醉了 在小镇上惹祸…</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:49.185 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:12:49.268 --> 00:12:53.522 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们在找麻烦
我们想让他们安静下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:12:53.606 --> 00:12:55.733 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后他们的同伙来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:12:55.816 --> 00:12:58.652 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>开始追我们 想报复我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:12:59.653 --> 00:13:01.739 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-他们去哪了？
-这边！</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:04.116 --> 00:13:04.950 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在那！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:05.659 --> 00:13:07.620 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好…好多人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:07.703 --> 00:13:08.913 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们人手太多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:09.497 --> 00:13:11.081 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家快进道场！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:14.543 --> 00:13:15.503 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:15.586 --> 00:13:16.587 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蜂须贺先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:17.588 --> 00:13:20.216 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>多好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:21.091 --> 00:13:26.555 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让他们看看
反抗菱万愚连队有什么后果！</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:27.598 --> 00:13:28.849 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想起来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:28.933 --> 00:13:31.560 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是菱万愚连队的</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:32.144 --> 00:13:34.021 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>菱万愚连队？</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:34.104 --> 00:13:36.649 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像民间犯罪组织</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:37.149 --> 00:13:40.528 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们比极道还危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:45.741 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这下不妙了 为什么这事
偏偏发生在剑心刚走的时候？</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:45.824 --> 00:13:46.742 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:46.825 --> 00:13:49.703 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我才没见过他 他去哪儿了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:49.787 --> 00:13:54.375 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我叫他去买东西了
米、盐、味增、酱油…</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:13:54.959 --> 00:13:56.085 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:13:56.168 --> 00:13:58.712 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你非得一次性买完吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:13:58.796 --> 00:14:00.798 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…我们该怎么办 薰小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:00.881 --> 00:14:02.925 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“我们”是什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:03.008 --> 00:14:04.885 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是你们这些蠢货惹的麻烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:04.969 --> 00:14:06.804 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是他们的错</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:07.555 --> 00:14:09.390 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那你才是真的蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:12.142 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你真的信他们说的话</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:14.979 --> 00:14:18.190 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我注意到你们刚刚跑的时候
嘴里有清酒的味道</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:18.274 --> 00:14:22.361 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>惹麻烦的不是菱万愚连队 而是你们</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:23.028 --> 00:14:27.533 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>然后你们和他们打了一架</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:28.033 --> 00:14:29.159 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.207 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的是这样吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:37.293 --> 00:14:38.460 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起…</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:44.091 --> 00:14:46.594 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们可不敢反抗菱万愚连队！</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:46.677 --> 00:14:48.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快出来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:48.429 --> 00:14:50.306 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不然
我们就毁了你们这没用的道场！</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:51.682 --> 00:14:54.894 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-木炮？
-他们哪找的这玩意儿？</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:55.519 --> 00:14:56.937 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>木炮</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:14:57.021 --> 00:15:00.024 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>橡木做的简易大炮</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:00.107 --> 00:15:04.069 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末时用粘土做的炮弹来射击</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:04.153 --> 00:15:07.865 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>威力比得上普通大炮</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:07.948 --> 00:15:12.411 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就是菱万愚连队的威力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:12.494 --> 00:15:15.956 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们以为你们的剑术很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:20.169 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们会为
打断我们兄弟的胳膊付出代价的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:21.545 --> 00:15:24.965 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们喝醉了 还用剑打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:25.049 --> 00:15:26.383 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤了人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:27.676 --> 00:15:30.554 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>菱万愚连队或许愚蠢粗暴</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:30.638 --> 00:15:32.848 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你们更差劲</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:33.432 --> 00:15:39.438 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们这些以前的徒弟
遇到困难就夹着尾巴逃走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:39.521 --> 00:15:43.567 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在遇到麻烦了才想到要回来啊？</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:48.197 --> 00:15:51.116 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们躲不了了 快出来</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:53.243 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>自己来带他们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:53.327 --> 00:15:55.329 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不在乎</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:55.412 --> 00:15:56.580 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么这样…</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:56.664 --> 00:16:01.335 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋！我们可是冲你和那女孩来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:01.418 --> 00:16:03.545 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁让你们帮那两混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:03.629 --> 00:16:05.297 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:05.381 --> 00:16:08.342 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>想报仇的话就冲着我来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:09.468 --> 00:16:12.346 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>放过他们三个</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:12.429 --> 00:16:15.015 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 你在做什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:15.099 --> 00:16:18.686 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们的剑术是我父亲和我教的</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:19.186 --> 00:16:24.775 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然他们离开了
但干的蠢事还是我的责任</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:24.858 --> 00:16:27.569 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我努力…</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:27.653 --> 00:16:30.990 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>教授活人剑来惠及他人</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:32.074 --> 00:16:34.868 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看来那只是空谈</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:36.412 --> 00:16:41.291 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 只要你有心想变强
在其他地方也可以成长</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:42.001 --> 00:16:43.293 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要努力训练哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:46.171 --> 00:16:49.508 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要一人承担责任？</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:51.051 --> 00:16:55.681 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>女武士也不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:59.184 --> 00:17:00.728 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别逗我笑了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:01.812 --> 00:17:05.482 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明神弥彦一点也不像那些败类！</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:06.066 --> 00:17:10.112 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可不会坐以待毙 看你受伤！</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:10.195 --> 00:17:11.321 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>蜂须贺先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:11.405 --> 00:17:13.157 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.701 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可不会放了你 我要杀了你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:15.784 --> 00:17:19.455 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“杀了你”听着可不好呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:20.789 --> 00:17:22.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:22.708 --> 00:17:24.334 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们或许做错了事</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:25.085 --> 00:17:27.546 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但不至于用大炮吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:27.629 --> 00:17:32.009 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束这场闹剧吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:32.092 --> 00:17:34.178 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>吵死了 你是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:34.261 --> 00:17:37.431 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-蜂须贺先生 这人不好惹
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:37.514 --> 00:17:42.519 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还记得那个靠一己之力
打倒剑客警官的浪客吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.354 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想就是他</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:44.438 --> 00:17:45.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>胆小鬼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:45.814 --> 00:17:48.317 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>区区浪客有什么好怕的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.778 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们可是有这个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:50.861 --> 00:17:52.488 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>准备发射木炮！</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:52.571 --> 00:17:53.822 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:17:54.656 --> 00:17:56.283 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-剑心！
-开炮！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:10.339 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这把逆刃刀的另一边</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:10.422 --> 00:18:13.801 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>除了砍人
可以毫不犹豫地砍倒任何物体</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:14.384 --> 00:18:15.761 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>重申一遍</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:17.554 --> 00:18:19.348 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束这场闹剧</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:21.725 --> 00:18:23.102 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好…</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:23.769 --> 00:18:25.104 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>正好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:25.604 --> 00:18:26.605 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>兄弟们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:26.688 --> 00:18:28.232 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是…是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:28.315 --> 00:18:29.316 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打道回府！</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:31.944 --> 00:18:32.903 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:33.403 --> 00:18:36.490 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下离开时发生了这么多事</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:36.573 --> 00:18:37.783 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>呃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:37.866 --> 00:18:40.327 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事了 回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:41.036 --> 00:18:44.665 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但从现在起 忘了自己是这里的徒弟</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:45.165 --> 00:18:46.959 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要再持剑了</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:18:49.753 --> 00:18:50.671 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>平</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:18:54.049 --> 00:18:55.175 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>肩膀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:18:56.176 --> 00:18:58.345 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>记得给医生好好看看</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:19:05.435 --> 00:19:07.312 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（徒弟）</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.986 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打起精神来 薰女士</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:15.988 --> 00:19:19.575 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算竭力教导徒弟正义之道</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:20.075 --> 00:19:22.828 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但有时候就是会教不到他们心里去</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:22.911 --> 00:19:24.663 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>（神谷薰）</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:24.746 --> 00:19:26.707 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要哭了</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:28.041 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都不像你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:34.798 --> 00:19:37.342 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才不会像他们一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:37.843 --> 00:19:40.470 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要加入你的道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:41.555 --> 00:19:44.683 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然不能一下子像剑心那么厉害</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:44.766 --> 00:19:47.644 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>首先 我得耐心点和你好好相处</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:50.731 --> 00:19:53.275 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！我们收拾收拾 开始练习！</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:54.985 --> 00:19:55.819 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:56.862 --> 00:20:00.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>有些人你确实能教到心里去</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:20:08.665 --> 00:20:10.959 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没时间胡闹了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:20:11.043 --> 00:20:12.377 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>快点 薰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:20:12.461 --> 00:20:14.254 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要快点变强！</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:20:14.338 --> 00:20:16.215 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以现在不侮辱我了 改直呼名了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:17.216 --> 00:20:18.884 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷活心流</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:20:18.967 --> 00:20:20.219 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>师父 无</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:20:20.886 --> 00:20:23.180 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>代理师父 神谷薰</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:20:23.263 --> 00:20:26.141 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>徒弟 明神弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

